'''Professor Wynd''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Weather Station}} at the top of the {{Zone|Mountain}}. They explain the [[Weather]] mechanic.

== Usage ==
With '''Professor Wynd'''<nowiki />'s {{Abiphone Contact}}, the player can have up to {{Green|4}} weather alerts active at a time, each tied to a specific weather type in a specific island.

